        "narrative": "<p>Composed of a high population of suckers, average populations of walleye and tullibee and below average populations of perch and smallmouth bass. The majority of the walleyes taken were from the 1976 (age IV) year class. Growth on the younger walleyes appears to be good, but seems to have slowed down as age III fish.</p>"
